[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891972\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/2891673\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892174\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891970\">5580C12</a></p><p>Closely observe the safety regulations established for this operation.</p><p>1. Loosen the band fixing the steering column switch unit.</p><p>2. Move the steering column switch unit.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b, 3c, 3d) and recover\nthe steering column switch unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">H5A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890363\">H5B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3c</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890368\">H5C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3d</p></td><td><p>Stalk unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890370\">H5D</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035449.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the steering column\nswitch unit is not damaged and, if necessary, conduct an electrical\ntest on it.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Refit the steering column switch unit.</p><p>Tighten the band fixing the steering column\nswitch unit.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891970\">5580C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892174\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891673\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891972\">5580C18</a></p><p>Check the operation of the systems involved\n(lights, wipers, horns).</p>"]]